function confessionalMatches(s){const out=[],re=/\b(WCF|WLC|WSC)\s+(\d+(?:\.\d+)?(?:\s*(?:to|[-–])\s*\d+(?:\.\d+)?)?)/gi;for(const m of s.matchAll(re)){if(out.some(x=>m.index>=x.start&&m.index<x.end))continue;let kind=m[1].toUpperCase(),start=m.index,end=m.index+m[0].length;out.push({start,end,kind,number:m[2],label:m[0],explicit:true});let pos=end;while(true){const next=s.slice(pos).match(/^\s*(?:,|;|\band\b)\s*(?:(WCF|WLC|WSC)\s+)?(\d+(?:\.\d+)?(?:\s*(?:to|[-–])\s*\d+(?:\.\d+)?)?)/i);if(!next)break;if(next[1])kind=next[1].toUpperCase();const offset=next[0].lastIndexOf(next[2]);start=pos+offset;end=pos+next[0].length;if(next[1])start=pos+next[0].indexOf(next[1]);out.push({start,end,kind,number:next[2],label:s.slice(start,end),explicit:!!next[1]});pos=end}}return out.sort((a,b)=>a.start-b.start)}
confessionLinks=function(value){const s=String(value),matches=confessionalMatches(s);let out='',pos=0;for(const m of matches){if(m.start<pos)continue;const [chapter,paragraph]=m.number.match(/^\d+(?:\.\d+)?/)[0].split('.');out+=esc(s.slice(pos,m.start))+`<a href="#standards/${m.kind.toLowerCase()}/${chapter}${paragraph?'/'+paragraph:''}">${esc(m.explicit?m.label:m.kind+' '+m.label)}</a>`;pos=m.end}return out+esc(s.slice(pos))};


// Fetch only the Scripture book being read. Reference validation uses the embedded verse counts.
const bibleRequests = new Map();
const loadedBibleBooks = new Set();
async function loadBibleBook(index) {
  if (loadedBibleBooks.has(index)) return;
  if (!bibleRequests.has(index)) {
    const request = fetch('assets/bible/'+String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')+'.json')
      .then(response => { if (!response.ok) throw new Error('Scripture could not load.'); return response.json(); })
      .then(book => { BIBLE[index].chapters=book.chapters; loadedBibleBooks.add(index); })
      .catch(error => { bibleRequests.delete(index); throw error; });
    bibleRequests.set(index,request);
  }
  await bibleRequests.get(index);
}
const drawLoadedBible = drawBible;
let bibleDrawRequest = 0;
drawBible = async function () {
  const request = ++bibleDrawRequest;
  const index = bibleState.bi;
  $('#bibleTitle').textContent = BIBLE[index].name+' '+bibleState.ch;
  $('#bibleText').textContent = 'Loading the passage…';
  try {
    await loadBibleBook(index);
    if (request === bibleDrawRequest) drawLoadedBible();
  } catch (error) {
    if (request !== bibleDrawRequest) return;
    $('#bibleText').textContent = 'The passage could not load. Check your connection and try again.';
    const retry = document.createElement('button');
    retry.className = 'button secondary small'; retry.textContent = 'Try again';
    retry.addEventListener('click',()=>drawBible()); $('#bibleText').appendChild(retry);
  }
};

render();


